            {
                "entry_id": "37c42f21-4304-369d-b54b-d12afec9fc92",
                "word": "ragdoll",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "dc2fcbc8-139a-4f81-9539-b34947efdaac",
                        "entry_id": "37c42f21-4304-369d-b54b-d12afec9fc92",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ragdolls"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4805a2a5-e686-38ba-840c-24f59a5ba9d7",
                        "entry_id": "37c42f21-4304-369d-b54b-d12afec9fc92",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A modern American breed of domestic cat with a longhair colourpoint coat that relaxes completely when picked up."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "87c6309c-88cb-3f0b-b002-9d7dc85e4e08",
                        "entry_id": "37c42f21-4304-369d-b54b-d12afec9fc92",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A model consisting of a set of connected rigid bodies that can collapse in a loose, natural manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1317e4ed-8046-4f43-bdc3-e05ea86fd4f2",
                                "sense_id": "87c6309c-88cb-3f0b-b002-9d7dc85e4e08",
                                "text": "In this chapter I'll give you a taste of some of the most popular applications for physics: ragdolls, breakable objects, and movie-style explosions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "50d941d8-01ff-4747-8746-c4b301a5a0cb",
                                "sense_id": "87c6309c-88cb-3f0b-b002-9d7dc85e4e08",
                                "text": "It is, in itself, a beautiful little game, but what it really indicates is a new way to create game controls: by simulating muscles rather than arbitrary forces. The rig in Ski Stunt Simulator is a controlled, active ragdoll."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b3a64e63-e430-38fa-be7d-9a8b974584f3",
                        "entry_id": "37c42f21-4304-369d-b54b-d12afec9fc92",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of rag doll (“doll made from cloth”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa19c77b-744b-402a-9de5-f70ebb064174",
                                "sense_id": "b3a64e63-e430-38fa-be7d-9a8b974584f3",
                                "text": "Eve came and tea’d with ragdolls, her children. She was strict with them. My tin soldiers weren’t fit company. […] Now she looks like one of her old ragdolls. O where have my tin soldiers gone?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa497b6e-eab6-4889-a8fc-755899fa522b",
                                "sense_id": "b3a64e63-e430-38fa-be7d-9a8b974584f3",
                                "text": "Aunt Jackie looked like one of Fleda’s old ragdolls after the play was done—couldn’t stand if she wanted to."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba79eef4-bf93-4b57-b8e9-891d7b730d8a",
                                "sense_id": "b3a64e63-e430-38fa-be7d-9a8b974584f3",
                                "text": "Let’s imagine your dream business is to sell homemade ragdolls inspired by an old ragdoll that was made by your great-grandmother in France."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b46c7c0e-392d-4c5c-9dc3-0efa76838e08",
                        "source_entry_id": "37c42f21-4304-369d-b54b-d12afec9fc92",
                        "source_sense_description": "cat breed",
                        "target_lang_word": "ragdoll",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ragdoll",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9aff5d7-f0f7-3be0-8fd0-257cd704c851",
                                        "entry_id": "0eea4249-9307-3033-baeb-acdaa2b4143f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Race de chat, originaire des États-Unis, à queue longue, à poil mi-long, et à robe colourpoint, mitted ou bicolore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50ac152c-576c-435b-ba2c-a79dde83a9fe",
                                                "sense_id": "a9aff5d7-f0f7-3be0-8fd0-257cd704c851",
                                                "text": "Les lauréats de chaque catégorie peuvent affronter les lauréats d’autres catégories, contre lesquels ils concourent pour le titre de champion. Le sacré de Birmanie entre alors en compétition avec l’ensemble des chats à poils mi-longs, le sibérien, le ragdoll et le maine coon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "ragdoll",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b07e57ef-36a8-3044-8706-ec1853b7ee85",
                                        "entry_id": "634dd6f8-3b8f-3203-8386-e12974af26ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Type d’animation procédurale où un modèle constitué d’un ensemble de corps rigides reliés s’effondre d’une manière naturelle, comme une poupée de chiffon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Jeux vidéo"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
